              <calculation class='tableau' formula='//(SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time current])-SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time previous]))/SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time previous])&#10;&#10;(SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time current (copy)_5481232632414855169])-SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time previous (copy)_5481232632416210947])) /SUM([Agent Chat Inactivity Time previous (copy)_5481232632416210947])' />
