    <worksheet name='Lightbulb : handling time of abandoned chats'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='herocare_agent_platform_kpi_tree_report' name='federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx'>
            <column caption='Date Range' datatype='date' name='[Date (copy)_5006876885817917441]' role='dimension' type='ordinal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[report_date]' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Agent Productivity' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.00;-#,##0.00' name='[Reach (copy)_5006876886179393618]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF SUM([agent_productivity_denominator]) &lt; 1&#10;THEN 0&#10;ELSE IFNULL(SUM([agent_productivity_numerator]) / SUM([agent_productivity_denominator]),0)&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Agent Productivity Denominator' datatype='real' default-format='n#,##0.00;-#,##0.00' name='[agent_productivity_denominator]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Agent Productivity Numerator' datatype='integer' name='[agent_productivity_numerator]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Contact Center' datatype='string' name='[contact_center]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Management Entity Group' datatype='string' name='[management_entity_group]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Date (copy)_5006876885817917441]' derivation='None' name='[none:Date (copy)_5006876885817917441:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[contact_center]' derivation='None' name='[none:contact_center:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[management_entity_group]' derivation='None' name='[none:management_entity_group:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[report_date]' derivation='None' name='[none:report_date:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Date' datatype='date' name='[report_date]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column-instance column='[Reach (copy)_5006876886179393618]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Reach (copy)_5006876886179393618:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx].[none:Date (copy)_5006876885817917441:qk]</column>
            <column>[federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx].[none:report_date:qk]</column>
            <column>[federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx].[none:management_entity_group:nk]</column>
            <column>[federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx].[none:contact_center:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' value='21' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Shape' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <lod column='[federated.147my0y177zl1w16t0vvu14ig1fx].[usr:Reach (copy)_5006876886179393618:qk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>This dashboard allows the user to view the share of abandoned chats in buckets of handling time</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>HOW TO USE :</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>1. Use the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Abandoned Chat Type&apos;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> parameter to chose what type of chat would you like to view handling time (in minutes) of i.e </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Agent abandoned chats </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'> or </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>Stakehodler abandoned chats</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>2. Type a whole number and hit Enter on  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Increment size for Chats (in mins)&apos; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>filter to chose the preferred size of each handling time bucket on the X axis i.e </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>1 min , 2 min , 50 mins , 100 mins etc.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>3. Type a whole number and hit Enter on  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Handling time (in mins) for bin aggregation&apos; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>filter to chose the handling time after which you would like  the chats to be aggregated into a single  bucket on the X axis i.e </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>50 mins, 100  mins , 3000 mins etc.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>4. Type whole number and hit Enter on  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>&apos;Abandoned chats handling time (in mins) filter&apos; </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>filter to limit the handling time that is viewed on this dashboardon the X axis i.e </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9' italic='true'>50 mins, 100  mins , 3000 mins etc.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='shape' value='Bug Tracking/light.png' />
                <format attr='size' value='2' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
